        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: What's Love Got to Do with It\n- People: Tina Turner, Ike Turner, Brian Gibson, Angela Bassett, Laurence Fishburne\n- Music acts: Ike & Tina Turner Revue\n- Concepts: biographical films, rock and roll\n\nFacts:\n- Ike Turner was an early pioneer of 1950s rock and roll.\n- In the 1960s and 1970s, Ike Turner was most popularly known for performing with his then-wife Tina Turner in the Ike & Tina Turner Revue.\n- What's Love Got to Do with It is a 1993 American biographical film directed by Brian Gibson and loosely based on the life of Tina Turner.\n- What's Love Got to Do with It stars Angela Bassett as Tina Turner and Laurence Fishburne as Ike Turner.",
